%U A398806 100203007,105641671,132782071,136652071,138973207,149796607,152114071,159834271,166005247,169089007,185259847,192180487,199863247
%N A398806 Numbers k such that psi(k) = phi(k) + tau(k)^9.
%C A398806 Contains all numbers of the form p*(2^17-p), where p and 2^17-p are both prime. Are there any other terms that are not of this form?
%H A398806 S. I. Dimitrov, <a href="https://github.com/Stoyan16/Numbers-k-such-that-psi-k-phi-k-tau-k-9/blob/main/A398806">Python program</a> (GitHub)
%e A398806 1703767 is a term since psi(1703767) = 1834840 = 1572696 + 4^9 = phi(1703767) + tau(1703767)^9.
%o A398806 (PARI) isok(k) = {my(f = factor(k)); prod(i=1, #f~, (f[i, 1]+1) * f[i, 1]^(f[i, 2]-1)) - eulerphi(f) == numdiv(f)^9; } \\ _Amiram Eldar_, Sep 09 2026
